WEBVTT

00:00:14.208 --> 00:00:15.583
<i>Towa and Setsuna.</i>

00:00:15.833 --> 00:00:20.583
<i>Between us half-demon twins,</i>
<i>two different worlds exist at the same time.</i>

00:00:21.708 --> 00:00:23.250
<i>Human and demon.</i>

00:00:23.417 --> 00:00:25.458
<i>Feudal era and present day.</i>

00:00:25.708 --> 00:00:27.208
<i>Peacefulness and war.</i>

00:00:27.417 --> 00:00:28.958
<i>Joy and sorrow.</i>

00:00:29.208 --> 00:00:30.333
<i>Dreams and reality.</i>

00:00:30.875 --> 00:00:32.417
<i>One moment and eternity.</i>

00:00:32.708 --> 00:00:35.250
<i>And finally, love and hate.</i>

00:00:36.417 --> 00:00:39.125
<i>A Feudal Fairytale,</i>
<i>Yashahime: Princess Half-Demon.</i>

00:00:39.667 --> 00:00:43.417
<i>We'll keep moving forward</i>
<i>through the hurdles of destiny!</i>

00:00:47.292 --> 00:00:50.125
HALF-DEMON GIRL – TOWA HIGURASHI

00:00:50.417 --> 00:00:51.500
<i>It's here.</i>

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:04.458
LEADER OF THE DEMON SLAYERS – KOHAKU
Nice work, Towa.

00:01:04.458 --> 00:01:07.083
Nanasuke, Rokuta, be careful of its poison.

00:01:07.292 --> 00:01:08.000
DEMON SLAYER ROKUTA
– Yeah!
– Leave it to us!

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:09.292
DEMON SLAYER
NANASUKE

00:01:11.125 --> 00:01:13.208
Bring it down, Hisui and Setsuna.

00:01:15.375 --> 00:01:16.667
Cyclone Burst!

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:22.042
MASTER OF HIRAIKOTSU – HISUI
Hiraikotsu!

00:01:25.583 --> 00:01:26.292
Amazing!

00:01:26.583 --> 00:01:29.208
They're getting better
at working together.

00:01:29.208 --> 00:01:31.167
DEMON SLAYER
SETSUNA

00:01:31.875 --> 00:01:35.667
And Towa, you're getting better
at sensing demon energy.

00:01:36.042 --> 00:01:38.708
Yeah, but just barely, I think...

00:03:24.208 --> 00:03:26.250
"Meeting through an Apple"

00:03:38.375 --> 00:03:41.125
ONE OF THE FOUR PERILS – KYUKI

00:03:47.875 --> 00:03:48.083
Master.

00:03:48.083 --> 00:03:50.917
BEAST KING RULING THE FOUR PERILS – KIRINMARU

00:03:51.708 --> 00:03:53.250
It is I, Kyuki.

00:03:53.875 --> 00:03:58.792
Tokotsu has been defeated by Beniyasha
and the daughters of Sesshomaru.

00:03:59.125 --> 00:04:02.500
The daughters of Sesshomaru?

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:09.417
Unless we take action,
I fear they will bring you disaster...

00:04:09.417 --> 00:04:13.708
By the way, Kyuki,
who is this Tokotsu again?

00:04:13.708 --> 00:04:17.042
He was one of the Four Perils
under your command.

00:04:17.042 --> 00:04:20.667
The one to whom you bestowed
the Red Rainbow Pearl.

00:04:21.083 --> 00:04:22.917
Ah, that's right...

00:04:23.250 --> 00:04:29.958
If Tokotsu served under me,
then he must have been quite the warrior.

00:04:30.333 --> 00:04:34.292
Defeated by Sesshomaru's daughters...
I must hand it to them.

00:04:34.583 --> 00:04:39.292
If you would allow me,
I can take care of this matter.

00:04:43.208 --> 00:04:45.167
It's not to my taste...

00:04:45.958 --> 00:04:50.042
Understood. Then <i>I </i>shall start with
Sesshomaru's daughters.

00:04:51.667 --> 00:04:53.917
VILLAGE ELDER PRIESTESS
KAEDE

00:04:53.917 --> 00:04:55.417
Welcome back.

00:04:55.750 --> 00:04:57.292
I'm back.

00:05:01.042 --> 00:05:01.667
Oh.

00:05:01.792 --> 00:05:04.625
That's right. Hey, Setsuna!

00:05:05.250 --> 00:05:07.208
Can you play your violin?

00:05:07.208 --> 00:05:08.833
That's fine.

00:05:23.083 --> 00:05:29.708
Mama Moe would play for me
whenever I came home after a fight...

00:05:38.792 --> 00:05:41.917
We sure bought a lot of stuff, huh, Setsuna?

00:05:41.917 --> 00:05:43.958
Are you sure it's okay
to buy so much?

00:05:44.208 --> 00:05:47.833
Don't worry about it!
It'll be my treat for today.

00:05:47.833 --> 00:05:49.042
Thank you.

00:05:49.042 --> 00:05:51.583
Oh, that's right. Here.

00:05:53.292 --> 00:05:54.792
Come on, Setsuna, you too.

00:06:04.083 --> 00:06:06.250
<i>Oh, thank goodness.</i>

00:06:06.625 --> 00:06:09.000
<i>Setsuna can finally fall asleep.</i>

00:06:12.750 --> 00:06:14.292
I'm glad.

00:06:15.208 --> 00:06:17.292
I'm so glad...

00:06:21.500 --> 00:06:23.458
We're not taking Towa with us?

00:06:23.667 --> 00:06:24.292
No.

00:06:26.292 --> 00:06:29.125
What?! She went to slay demons?

00:06:29.458 --> 00:06:31.125
Without me?!

00:06:31.292 --> 00:06:34.000
You were sleeping so peacefully.

00:06:34.875 --> 00:06:38.000
Unbelievable!
How can she leave me behind?!

00:06:38.458 --> 00:06:40.500
It's like... It's like she thinks
I'm in the way or something!

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:43.083
JAGAKON / TASTY PORK / SPRING WATER

00:06:43.083 --> 00:06:44.667
But I guess I'll have to...

00:06:45.625 --> 00:06:47.458
...prove that I can be reliable!

00:06:47.958 --> 00:06:49.292
Are you heading out?

00:06:50.458 --> 00:06:52.542
I'm off to find Mount Musubi's butterfly.

00:06:53.083 --> 00:06:56.583
After all, that's why I came to this world.

00:06:56.583 --> 00:06:58.333
Okay, I'm heading out!

00:07:03.708 --> 00:07:06.875
East is that way. Okay, let's go!

00:07:17.792 --> 00:07:19.667
Geez, this tastes disgusting.

00:07:19.667 --> 00:07:23.125
I guess it's pointless
to use a modern map...

00:07:23.417 --> 00:07:25.667
KANTO AREA ROAD MAP

00:07:25.667 --> 00:07:29.708
There's not a single thing
Moroha brought that's actually useful.

00:07:29.708 --> 00:07:32.167
You seemed troubled by something,
Mr. Samurai.

00:07:35.083 --> 00:07:36.208
PIRATE WASHED ASHORE – RIKU

00:07:36.208 --> 00:07:38.000
Is something the matter?

00:07:39.875 --> 00:07:42.792
Oh, I'm no one suspicious,
I promise you.

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:47.708
Okay, then don't bother me.

00:07:48.125 --> 00:07:52.708
Oh no, I can't do that.
I'm also lost, you see.

00:07:53.000 --> 00:07:56.917
"Also"? Don't loop me in with you.

00:07:57.417 --> 00:07:59.667
But you have lost your way,
haven't you?

00:07:59.833 --> 00:08:03.917
I haven't lost my way,
I'm looking for the Dream Butterfly.

00:08:05.375 --> 00:08:08.583
I doubt butterflies are common
at this time of year.

00:08:08.875 --> 00:08:11.583
I heard there are some
at Mount Musubi.

00:08:11.583 --> 00:08:12.708
What's this?

00:08:12.708 --> 00:08:15.500
I thought you were a samurai,
but you're a princess.

00:08:15.500 --> 00:08:17.958
I'm terribly sorry for my mistake.

00:08:19.333 --> 00:08:21.417
Please wait, my princess.

00:08:21.625 --> 00:08:24.667
I'm having trouble finding
my way back to my ship.

00:08:24.667 --> 00:08:27.208
Ship? Does that mean the ocean is nearby?

00:08:27.333 --> 00:08:29.667
That's the one thing I'm sure of.

00:08:30.250 --> 00:08:33.417
Dang it. I thought I was heading
to the mountains,

00:08:33.417 --> 00:08:36.208
but I ended up closer to the sea.

00:08:37.583 --> 00:08:40.792
You're right,
I smell water from that direction.

00:08:40.792 --> 00:08:41.500
Thank you.

00:08:42.583 --> 00:08:43.708
Okay, let's go.

00:08:43.708 --> 00:08:45.042
Whoa, hey!

00:08:51.792 --> 00:08:54.000
TEAMASTER – SOKYU

00:08:56.708 --> 00:08:59.500
So this is the ocean?

00:09:01.042 --> 00:09:04.125
I guess it's a bit too small
to be an ocean!

00:09:04.125 --> 00:09:07.833
But if I follow this river,
it'll lead me to the ocean.

00:09:08.333 --> 00:09:10.500
Thank you, you've been a great help.

00:09:14.000 --> 00:09:18.042
This feels nice.
Feels perfect for a picnic.

00:09:26.625 --> 00:09:27.667
Oh, wow.

00:09:28.083 --> 00:09:30.292
Is that some kind of magic trick?

00:09:32.083 --> 00:09:35.917
Anyone can do this
with a little bit of focus!

00:09:36.292 --> 00:09:38.292
I'm sure you can, too, Princess.

00:09:39.625 --> 00:09:41.125
You think so?

00:09:41.208 --> 00:09:43.500
Hey Mister, care to join me?

00:09:44.833 --> 00:09:48.208
Not to be rude, Princess,
but I'm no "Mister."

00:09:48.375 --> 00:09:50.958
The name is Riku.

00:09:51.333 --> 00:09:52.500
And yours, Princess?

00:09:52.792 --> 00:09:56.708
Well, I'm no princess.
I'm Towa Higurashi.

00:09:57.083 --> 00:09:59.792
So you're Riku, huh? Got it.

00:10:01.250 --> 00:10:04.875
Just remember me as
Riku the pirate, Lady Towa.

00:10:05.167 --> 00:10:06.917
What?! You're a pirate?

00:10:06.917 --> 00:10:12.500
Rest assured. I don't take from
women, children, or the poor.

00:10:14.875 --> 00:10:17.667
Wow, these are all fascinating things.

00:10:17.667 --> 00:10:20.375
POTATO CHIPS / JAGAKON / MINTY FRESH
And these are all edible?

00:10:20.375 --> 00:10:21.708
Help yourself!

00:10:21.708 --> 00:10:23.083
Well, don't mind if I do!

00:10:26.208 --> 00:10:28.625
Delicious! Such a wonderful flavor.

00:10:28.625 --> 00:10:30.708
I've never had something so delicious!

00:10:31.042 --> 00:10:34.417
Yeah, I think that apple tastes the best.

00:10:34.417 --> 00:10:38.917
Selective breeding has come a long way,
and things taste much better now.

00:10:39.917 --> 00:10:41.500
So this is an apple.

00:10:41.500 --> 00:10:46.292
Unbelievable! A taste like this would
surely banish you from paradise.

00:10:47.083 --> 00:10:49.958
Oh, and I'll take the core
once you're done.

00:10:49.958 --> 00:10:55.542
KANTO AREA ROAD MAP
Can't be having it take root
and mess up the course of history!

00:10:55.542 --> 00:11:00.125
I ate the whole thing, core and all!
Thank you for the hospitality.

00:11:02.333 --> 00:11:06.125
As one abandoned by his master,
it's more than I deserve...

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:11.667
Lady Towa,
you've fed me the forbidden fruit.

00:11:11.750 --> 00:11:13.708
Huh? Forbidden fruit?

00:11:14.875 --> 00:11:20.583
KANTO AREA ROAD MAP
Anyway, Lady Towa,
could that katana be the Kikujumonji?

00:11:20.583 --> 00:11:24.875
It was a fake, apparently.
It broke pretty easily.

00:11:24.875 --> 00:11:25.917
I should think so.

00:11:26.583 --> 00:11:29.000
The real one should be
with Ogigayatsu Hiiragi,

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:33.417
the Deputy Shogun of Kanto,
as it was bestowed from the shogun.

00:11:33.708 --> 00:11:36.875
The shogun? Deputy Shogun of Kanto?

00:11:36.958 --> 00:11:40.583
Well, I must repay
your kindness for the apple.

00:11:44.542 --> 00:11:47.500
If fate allows it, we shall meet again.

00:11:47.917 --> 00:11:49.792
Until then, farewell.

00:11:55.667 --> 00:11:56.833
Hey!

00:11:57.917 --> 00:12:00.292
Wait, you forgot this.

00:12:00.958 --> 00:12:05.042
I would like to present that to you as a gift.
Please accept it.

00:12:05.583 --> 00:12:07.250
What is this?

00:12:10.083 --> 00:12:12.417
<i>I hope you like it, dear princess.</i>

00:12:12.542 --> 00:12:13.708
A katana?

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:16.500
Wait, is this real?

00:12:21.042 --> 00:12:23.708
Amazing. So this is the real thing...

00:12:25.542 --> 00:12:30.625
<i>I recently stole that katana</i>
<i>from Ogigayatsu Hiiragi,</i>

00:12:30.625 --> 00:12:32.708
<i>so it's the genuine Kikujumonji.</i>

00:12:34.375 --> 00:12:37.917
There he goes.
Who was he anyway?

00:12:38.083 --> 00:12:39.625
Hey, you there.

00:12:40.042 --> 00:12:44.125
We are retainers of the Deputy Shogun,
Ogigayatsu Hiiragi.

00:12:44.583 --> 00:12:47.708
So you're the one who stole
that katana a few days ago!

00:12:47.708 --> 00:12:49.125
Uh, no, I...

00:12:49.333 --> 00:12:51.500
We're taking you into custody!

00:12:51.917 --> 00:12:54.708
Wait, I didn't steal this!

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:57.708
We've captured you,
Princess Half-Demon.

00:12:58.208 --> 00:13:02.500
Those clothes are, without a doubt,
from the other world.

00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:04.167
<i>An apparition?</i>

00:13:04.667 --> 00:13:08.000
Lord Sokyu, we also found
these tea ceremony utensils.

00:13:08.000 --> 00:13:10.375
Bring all of it back to the estate.

00:13:10.375 --> 00:13:11.417
Yes, sir.

00:13:23.583 --> 00:13:25.792
Are you the one they call
Princess Half-Demon?

00:13:26.167 --> 00:13:27.375
I am the Deputy Shogun of Kanto,
Ogigayatsu Hiiragi Danjo.

00:13:27.375 --> 00:13:30.792
DEPUTY SHOGUN OF KANTO – OGIGAYATSU HIIRAGI DANJO

00:13:31.167 --> 00:13:33.375
The name's Towa Higurashi.

00:13:33.792 --> 00:13:36.792
Sorry, but I'm no
Princess Half-Demon.

00:13:37.250 --> 00:13:40.208
So she says, Sokyu.

00:13:40.208 --> 00:13:43.417
My Lord, let me, if you will.

00:13:43.875 --> 00:13:46.333
Princess Half-Demon,
I have here a book that you were carrying.

00:13:46.333 --> 00:13:47.917
NEW SOCIAL STUDIES AND HISTORY

00:13:49.208 --> 00:13:52.333
<i>That idiot! Why'd she have to</i>
<i>bring that back with her?</i>

00:13:52.875 --> 00:13:56.833
You know, you should take my advice
and let me go.

00:13:57.500 --> 00:14:00.833
Things won't be so hot
when my friends get here.

00:14:02.833 --> 00:14:04.375
Such nonsense.

00:14:04.375 --> 00:14:07.042
There is something
I would like for you to see.

00:14:10.958 --> 00:14:12.458
Is that a bike seat?

00:14:13.333 --> 00:14:15.250
You recognize what this is!

00:14:15.250 --> 00:14:18.500
Indeed.
It seems she knows something.

00:14:19.250 --> 00:14:20.833
What's a thing like that doing here?

00:14:23.292 --> 00:14:25.750
There used to be rumors
in the Musashi Province...

00:14:25.750 --> 00:14:31.708
of a priestess who came through the
Bone Eater's Well from a place called "Tokyo."

00:14:32.583 --> 00:14:35.625
<i>Tokyo? Well? Priestess?</i>

00:14:35.917 --> 00:14:42.500
She and a half-demon named Inuyasha
traveled the land slaying demons.

00:14:42.958 --> 00:14:48.833
What I'm about to share is a tale
that I heard over a decade ago.

00:14:51.167 --> 00:14:53.667
She went to find
Mount Musubi's butterfly?

00:14:53.958 --> 00:14:58.792
She mentioned wanting to prove
that she wasn't a nuisance.

00:14:59.667 --> 00:15:02.208
And here I thought
you were being happily tamed.

00:15:02.208 --> 00:15:05.083
Of course this happens
once the collar comes off.

00:15:05.667 --> 00:15:08.375
Are you heading to
Mount Musubi as well?

00:15:08.750 --> 00:15:12.500
No, I'm going to search for the dog
that strayed from the pack.

00:15:14.208 --> 00:15:17.250
So this time it's Kyuki,
one of the Four Perils.

00:15:17.375 --> 00:15:18.000
BOUNTY HUNTER – MOROHA

00:15:18.000 --> 00:15:22.292
These requests to slay
big name demons keep coming in.

00:15:22.292 --> 00:15:24.375
Who keeps requesting 'em, huh?

00:15:24.458 --> 00:15:26.833
YOUNG RACCOON DOG DEMON – TAKECHIYO
Takechiyo, I know you know something.

00:15:26.833 --> 00:15:29.042
It's better that you don't know.

00:15:29.042 --> 00:15:33.667
Master Jyubei said the requests are
from someone he can't say no to.

00:15:33.708 --> 00:15:35.083
I see.

00:15:35.375 --> 00:15:38.625
Master Jyubei has graciously
given you advance payment.

00:15:38.625 --> 00:15:41.917
You need to stop complaining
and carry out your job!

00:15:41.917 --> 00:15:44.083
Geez, I know.

00:15:46.333 --> 00:15:50.583
She was definitely here,
but Mount Musubi is the other way.

00:15:50.583 --> 00:15:52.792
Hey, Setsuna!

00:15:53.250 --> 00:15:56.917
I got another demon slaying job
from Mr. Jyubei.

00:15:57.208 --> 00:15:58.333
I see.

00:15:59.833 --> 00:16:02.500
Huh? You're not with Towa today?

00:16:02.917 --> 00:16:05.333
Looks like she got lost somewhere.

00:16:05.583 --> 00:16:08.125
I've been trying to reach her,
but she hasn't responded.

00:16:08.625 --> 00:16:11.583
Hah! So she's hopeless, as usual.

00:16:11.583 --> 00:16:13.208
That's strange.

00:16:13.208 --> 00:16:14.917
According to Master Jyubei,

00:16:14.917 --> 00:16:19.375
Towa is the most reliable out of you
three Half-Demon Princesses.

00:16:19.625 --> 00:16:23.458
What do you mean?
She's the most useless one.

00:16:23.708 --> 00:16:27.833
I even have proof.
She's close to where Kyuki is located.

00:16:27.833 --> 00:16:28.792
You're kidding.

00:16:28.958 --> 00:16:34.417
And she's gained an audience with Ogigayatsu
Hiiragi Danjo, the Deputy Shogun of Kanto.

00:16:34.417 --> 00:16:37.750
She's probably accepting
a gift as her reward by now!

00:16:38.875 --> 00:16:40.375
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:16:41.542 --> 00:16:43.167
Hey, wait a sec, Setsuna.

00:16:43.958 --> 00:16:46.250
It's the Deputy Shogun's estate, right?

00:16:46.250 --> 00:16:47.708
Takechiyo, can you take us?

00:16:47.708 --> 00:16:52.583
Fine, but this time,
make sure to get Kyuki's head!

00:16:56.000 --> 00:16:58.792
So you've come, Half-Demon Princesses.

00:16:59.208 --> 00:17:02.833
With this, the Gold, Silver,
and Red Rainbow Pearls will gather,

00:17:02.833 --> 00:17:06.667
and in one fell swoop,
I will have four Rainbow Pearls.

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:12.375
If I succeed, I'll possess more
demon energy than Master Kirinmaru.

00:17:13.250 --> 00:17:17.708
Fubuki, steal the Rainbow Pearls
from those girls!

00:17:20.208 --> 00:17:21.667
Not to worry.

00:17:22.042 --> 00:17:26.208
I can simply leave the
Silver Rainbow Pearl to Yotsume.

00:17:27.042 --> 00:17:29.208
And that demon was Root Head,

00:17:29.208 --> 00:17:34.042
which spread its roots underground
and absorbed nutrients from humans.

00:17:40.208 --> 00:17:40.917
It's here.

00:17:47.667 --> 00:17:50.333
ICE AND SNOW DEMON BEAST – FUBUKI

00:17:53.625 --> 00:17:55.500
It was waiting to ambush us.

00:17:55.500 --> 00:17:56.583
Is that Kyuki?

00:17:56.708 --> 00:18:00.125
That's one of Kyuki's underlings,
an apparition named Fubuki.

00:18:00.500 --> 00:18:02.167
I've heard of it.

00:18:02.167 --> 00:18:05.042
An ice and snow demon beast
that nests in the North.

00:18:05.292 --> 00:18:06.792
Ice and snow...

00:18:07.542 --> 00:18:08.125
Moroha.

00:18:09.250 --> 00:18:10.250
Should I do it?

00:18:10.250 --> 00:18:11.917
Don't use your rouge.

00:18:11.917 --> 00:18:13.875
I can take small fry with this.

00:18:14.375 --> 00:18:15.875
Scourge of Swallows!

00:18:28.667 --> 00:18:30.458
Does it not have a real body?

00:18:30.458 --> 00:18:34.167
That's not it.
That giant form is like fog.

00:18:34.167 --> 00:18:36.750
Its main body is hiding somewhere.

00:18:36.833 --> 00:18:39.042
Damn it, where could it be?!

00:18:39.417 --> 00:18:41.500
But then, Root Head said,
"I'll eat you whole, Shikon Jewel and all!"

00:18:41.500 --> 00:18:44.042
<i>Setsuna and Moroha are close by.</i>

00:18:47.375 --> 00:18:50.042
<i>Apparitions sure do talk a lot.</i>

00:18:52.167 --> 00:18:57.250
<i>And there's one more.</i>
<i>It's small, but I sense another apparition.</i>

00:19:00.375 --> 00:19:05.500
FUBUKI'S MAIN BODY
<i>Setsuna and the others must be fighting that tiny polar bear.</i>

00:19:05.500 --> 00:19:09.250
<i>Come on, focus. </i>
<i>I have to save Setsuna.</i>

00:19:18.458 --> 00:19:19.042
There!

00:19:19.625 --> 00:19:21.083
I heard Towa's breath.

00:19:21.083 --> 00:19:22.125
Really?

00:19:22.125 --> 00:19:23.667
She's at the village over there.

00:19:24.000 --> 00:19:25.958
Fubuki's main body is there, too.

00:19:26.292 --> 00:19:29.125
I see, so that's how it is. If so...

00:19:32.708 --> 00:19:34.833
I found it. It's Fubuki's main body.

00:19:36.292 --> 00:19:37.417
Pierce through...

00:19:38.042 --> 00:19:38.958
Sacred Arrow!

00:19:44.500 --> 00:19:45.167
<i>Now!</i>

00:19:51.292 --> 00:19:53.667
<i>Yes! We did it.</i>

00:20:01.750 --> 00:20:06.167
Hate to admit it, but I think
what Mr. Jyubei said might be true.

00:20:06.167 --> 00:20:07.292
About what?

00:20:07.458 --> 00:20:10.875
That Towa might be the most reliable
out of the three of us.

00:20:12.000 --> 00:20:14.500
She causes us the most trouble, too.

00:20:18.167 --> 00:20:22.917
Now, Princess Half-Demon,
if you would regale us with your tale...

00:20:23.292 --> 00:20:27.375
You know, don't you?
What will happen to the Shogunate?

00:20:27.708 --> 00:20:29.375
The fate of our clan?

00:20:29.958 --> 00:20:30.875
Your Excellency...

00:20:32.083 --> 00:20:32.917
What is it?

00:20:33.542 --> 00:20:34.417
Run.

00:20:34.958 --> 00:20:35.917
What?

00:20:35.917 --> 00:20:37.708
– Hey!
– Intruder!

00:20:38.208 --> 00:20:41.458
– You'll get hurt if you stay here.
– Who are you?

00:20:43.042 --> 00:20:44.083
What is happening?

00:20:44.083 --> 00:20:44.875
Intruder!

00:20:44.875 --> 00:20:45.917
Shut up!

00:20:47.875 --> 00:20:49.625
They're so weak.

00:20:50.500 --> 00:20:54.875
Come on Towa, we're going home!
Quit loafing around here.

00:20:55.458 --> 00:20:57.250
You are such a handful...

00:21:00.417 --> 00:21:02.542
Thank you, Setsuna and Moroha.

00:21:02.833 --> 00:21:04.750
Who are you?

00:21:05.042 --> 00:21:07.417
Who are we? Well...

00:21:09.292 --> 00:21:10.792
Oh?

00:21:10.792 --> 00:21:13.333
I knew I smelled something
strange in the air.

00:21:13.333 --> 00:21:15.292
So it was you, Yotsume!

00:21:16.583 --> 00:21:20.292
Since you're here, I might as
well take you out, too!

00:21:21.333 --> 00:21:22.417
You're attacking too soon!

00:21:25.333 --> 00:21:26.750
An apparition?!

00:21:27.250 --> 00:21:28.125
Oh, shit!

00:21:28.250 --> 00:21:29.250
You're open!

00:21:40.458 --> 00:21:42.750
What a sore loser...

00:21:42.750 --> 00:21:44.292
Wait, Moroha.

00:21:44.583 --> 00:21:48.750
He seems to know things.
We should nab him and make him talk.

00:21:48.750 --> 00:21:51.292
Then we do have to chase after him!

00:21:55.083 --> 00:21:56.000
Your Excellency.

00:21:58.000 --> 00:21:59.667
I'll be taking this.

00:22:01.458 --> 00:22:03.167
Who were they?

00:22:03.167 --> 00:22:04.792
Oh, that's right.

00:22:05.958 --> 00:22:07.917
And I'll be taking this, too.

00:22:07.917 --> 00:22:09.708
NEW SOCIAL STUDIES AND HISTORY

00:22:09.708 --> 00:22:12.333
Well, see you around!

00:23:42.958 --> 00:23:44.500
NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW

00:23:44.500 --> 00:23:46.250
The owl demon Yotsume.

00:23:46.250 --> 00:23:49.542
I'll catch him and find out
whatever he's scheming!

00:23:49.542 --> 00:23:52.458
I won't let you get away.
Heavenly Arrow Barrage!

00:23:52.458 --> 00:23:57.125
But he uses the power of a
Rainbow Pearl to unleash a cruel spell.

00:23:57.292 --> 00:24:00.875
He's searching for weaknesses by
looking inside our heads.

00:24:00.875 --> 00:24:02.375
Who is this woman?

00:24:02.958 --> 00:24:06.250
Next time on <i>Yashahime: Princess Half-Demon</i>:
"The Dream Gazing Trap"

00:24:06.250 --> 00:24:24.022
How pitiful. Do you not agree,
daughter of Sesshomaru?
